    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060470/extras/e02c9c4f145f76647b5441dec25822df.poster.avif?t=1726846596\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060470/extras/e02c9c4f145f76647b5441dec25822df.webm?t=1726846596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060470/extras/e02c9c4f145f76647b5441dec25822df.mp4?t=1726846596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Disclaimer: Footage in the gifs has been sped up)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Giant capital ship combat - Conquer the Stars! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Engage in epic battles with 3 legendary ship manufacturers: Anvil Heavy Industries, Interstellar Orbital Command, and Northstar Alliance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Level up ship manufacturers for discounts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-10+ unique ships with more thrilling vessels on the horizon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060470/extras/d4c19d613408644cbe6fb98afd20afd7.poster.avif?t=1726846596\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060470/extras/d4c19d613408644cbe6fb98afd20afd7.webm?t=1726846596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060470/extras/d4c19d613408644cbe6fb98afd20afd7.mp4?t=1726846596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Assemble Your Ultimate Crew!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Customize your ship's crew with over 50 members, each boosting your ship's performance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Mix and match talents to create a formidable team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060470/extras/f163e022b8753e35037b214edf020449.poster.avif?t=1726846596\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060470/extras/f163e022b8753e35037b214edf020449.webm?t=1726846596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060470/extras/f163e022b8753e35037b214edf020449.mp4?t=1726846596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Intense Space Combat!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Brace yourself for the battle of a lifetime! Face space boogers, drones, mercenaries, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Conquer 10 difficulty levels as you fight off hordes of enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Earn Epic Rewards!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up your player profile and reap the rewards as you complete daring missions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Are you ready to take on the unknown and lead the Vanguard Fleet to greatness?<br> Let's embark on your journey among the stars!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Coming in future updates!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controller support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Plug in and play (some controllers may not work)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Modules - Equip, Upgrade, and Dominate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Choose from over 100+ modules to maximize your ship's potential and dominate the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> Elite Vanguard Skills!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Master Elite Vanguard Skills, unleashing devastating attacks upon your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore New Frontiers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Venture into a total of 8 thrilling sectors filled with secrets and challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Sectors currently playable, Sector 1)</p>",
