\"bb_paragraph\">-Master Elite Vanguard Skills, unleashing devastating attacks upon your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore New Frontiers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Venture into a total of 8 thrilling sectors filled with secrets and challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Sectors currently playable, Sector 1)</p>",
